OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police sergeant denies
OL,4,Amisconduct charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police sergeant who allegedly
OL,7,Fsought improper relationships with
OL,8,Feight women - including two colleagues
OL,9,Fand a domestic abuse victim - has
OL,10,Fdenied 10 offences.
OL,12,FTarjinderjit Nizzer, who resigned as a
OL,13,Fsergeant with Derbyshire Police in
OL,14,FFebruary, is accused of committing the
OL,15,Foffences - including asking for selfies
OL,16,Fand suggesting meetings - as a serving
OL,17,Fofficer.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
