OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police sergeant denies
OL,4,Amisconduct charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe faces eight counts of misconduct in
OL,7,Fpublic office relating to incidents
OL,8,Fsaid to have happened between January
OL,9,F2020 and November 2024, along with
OL,10,Fattempting to pervert the course of
OL,11,Fjustice by cancelling a traffic offence
OL,12,Freport, and computer misuse.
OL,14,FNizzer appeared at Nottingham Crown
OL,15,FCourt on Monday, and denied all the
OL,16,Fcharges.
